# Copy to /etc/brain/brain.env with mode 0600.
BRAIN_CONFIG=/etc/brain/brain.toml
# Alternatively, keep the TOML free of token digests and provide these from a
# root-only secret manager/environment. Never put raw tokens in Git.
# BRAIN_RENO_TOKEN_HASH=<64 hex characters>
# BRAIN_FAMAAGENT_TOKEN_HASH=<different 64 hex characters>
